<title>SWITZERLAND: Kuoni details 1996 results.</title>
<headline>Kuoni details 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calender 1996</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p>Results by division</p>
<p>Kuoni Switzerland</p>
<p> - Sales			  1,705	     vs 1,437</p>
<p> - Operating profit	   25.6		vs 19.7</p>
<p>Kuoni Britain</p>
<p> - Sales			  549		 vs 475</p>
<p> - Operating profit	   54.1		vs 50.5</p>
<p>Kuoni International</p>
<p> - Sales			  989		 vs 769</p>
<p> - Operating profit	   8.1		 vs 2.1</p>
<p>Kuoni Incoming</p>
<p> - Sales			  264		 vs 228</p>
<p> - Operating profit	   0.5		 vs 1.8 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Swiss travel group and tour operator Kuoni Reisen AG earlier said 1996 group net profit rose 53.5 percent to 69.4 million Swiss francs.</p>
<p>In a breakdown of results, Kuoni also said operating profit from two hotels it owns on Antigua and Barbados was 1.6 million Swiss francs vs 1.5 million in 1995.</p>
<p>Financial results were lower at 19.8 million vs 22.3 million, which Kuoni blamed on exchange rate volatility in late 1996 which led to some non-operative losses.</p>
<p>Taxes rose slightly to 24.1 million francs vs 22.6 million in 1995, Kuoni said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
